  "scope": {
    "what_this_is": [
      "Continuation segments 10001-20000 (10 ps) for bulk_r1 and interface_r1.",
      "CP2K input is the parent input plus one &EXT_RESTART block; every scientific setting (functional, box, charge, thermostat, timestep, output cadence, STEPS=10000) is byte-identical.",
